## Proposed Changes

### 1. Database & Authentication Overhaul (Backend)
We need to update the SQLite schemas to support all the fields mentioned in Phase 1.
#### [MODIFY] `core/database.py`
- Update `doctors` table schema to include: `full_name`, `license_no`, `state`, `hospital_email`, `phone`, `otp_secret`.
- Update `hospitals` (or create it if it doesn't exist) to include: `hospital_name`, `address`, `reg_no`, `admin_details`, `official_email`, `phone`, `otp_secret`.
#### [MODIFY] `app/main.py`
- Update the `/api/doctor/login` and `/api/hospital/login` routes to validate the new fields and OTP.
- Create `/api/doctor/register` and `/api/hospital/register` endpoints.

---

### 2. Frontend Routing & Layouts (Next.js)
We will use Next.js Route Groups `(doctor)` and `(hospital)` to cleanly separate the two experiences without cluttering the URL structure.

