- Implement the Doctor sidebar: Dashboard, Analysis & Reports, Models, Patients, Laboratory & Imaging, Settings.
#### [NEW] `frontend/components/hospital-layout.tsx` (Modify existing)
- Implement the Hospital sidebar: Dashboard, My Model, Model MP, Create New, Version, Integrations, Setting.

